    "description": {
      "value": "<p class=\"feature\"><em>Trigger:</em> A creature misses the [[lookup @name lowercase]] with a melee attack roll using a weapon. <em>Response—Strength Saving Throw:</em> DC [[lookup @save.dc.value activity=A8a55LxaAvNmIUnj]], the triggering creature. <em>Failure:</em> The attack’s weapon sticks to the [[lookup @name lowercase]]’s shield. If the target doesn’t let go of the weapon, the target has the &amp;Reference[Grappled apply=false] condition while the weapon is stuck (escape DC [[lookup @skills.ath.passive]]). While stuck, the weapon can’t be used. The target can take an action to make a [[/check ath dc=@skills.ath.passive format=long]], freeing the weapon on a success.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
